B.aaE=new A.kR("\ud83c\udccf","Welcome to Capture Tens","A strategic 4-player trick-taking card game where your goal is to capture the most 10s!","You play in teams of 2 (seats 0+2 vs 1+3)",B.O)
B.aaB=new A.kR("\ud83c\udfaf","Capture the 10s","The team that captures the most 10-value cards over 13 tricks wins the match. There are four 10s in the deck \u2014 one per suit.","Tiebreakers: most 10s, then most cards, then most aces",B.f)
B.aaF=new A.kR("\u26a1","The Power Suit","Before play begins, the first player chooses a Power Suit (trump) after seeing their first 5 cards. Cards of this suit beat ALL other suits!","Choose the suit you have the most cards in",B.fv)
